<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-SFE wheat futures firm on cash, pool prices.</title>
<headline>RTRS-SFE wheat futures firm on cash, pool prices.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The focus shifted to the July 1997 contract in Sydney Futures Exchange (SFE) wheat futures trading on Wednesday. Ten lots traded at $178.00 a tonne, up A$2.00. Other contracts did not trade.</p>
<p>Kerrin Gleeson of Elders Risk Managemenbt Pty Ltd said firm cash prices, pool prices and Chicago prices were all encouraging the SFE wheat futures market.  </p>
